This is the 0BSD license, used because it is what upstream Limine
templates use. One third-party build-time dependency, fetched by
kernel/get-deps, keeps its own license:

  - include/limine.h -- BSD-2-Clause (Limine-Bootloader/limine-protocol)

Not vendored in this repository; get-deps downloads it fresh at build
time (see kernel/get-deps).

The console/boot-splash font (kernel/src/video/nx_font8x8.h/.c) is
this project's own -- hand-designed, not derived from any external
font -- and is covered by this repository's own license like any
other source file, not a third-party one.
